-- statement:
--   **The configured chirp map is an `FPApprox` of every fitted line map.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6AMath5`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6A.chirpC_fp (p s t α H : ℕ) [NeZero s] [NeZero t] (hst : s ≤ t) (hα : 2 ≤ α)
--       (hαp : α ^ 2 ≤ p) (hH : 1 ≤ H) (hH2 : H ≤ 2 * sWidth p α) (hθ : 300 * (t - s) ≤ s)
--       (hp : 3 ≤ p) (hWp : 12 * (H + sWidth p α + 3) ≤ 2 ^ (p / 2))
--       (L : (ZMod s → ℂ) →L[ℂ] (ZMod t → ℂ))
--       (hL : ∀ U, InDisc p U → ∀ k : ZMod t,
--         ‖gC (Sapprox p s t α U k.val) - 2 ^ p * L (fun j => gC (U j.val) / 2 ^ p) k‖
--           ≤ 6 * sWidth p α + 4) :
--       FPApprox p (chirpC p s t α H) (NLogN.KFM.liftL L) (12 * sWidth p α + 11)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** A lines (PR #5 block chirp), part 5: the configured chirp map
--
--   Precision `P = 2p`, output exponent `σ = ⌊p/2⌋`, half-block `1 ≤ H ≤ 2m` (`m = sWidth p α`),
--   window half-width `W = H + m + 3`.
--
--   * `chirpA_congr`: `chirpA` reads only `[0, s)`.
--   * `chirp_sigma`: `exp(π s(t-s)H²/(t²α²)) ≤ 2^{⌊p/2⌋}` once `300 (t-s) ≤ s`.
--   * **`chirpC_fp`**: `chirpC` is an `FPApprox` of `liftL L` within `12 m + 11` for every line map
--     `L` fitted to `Sapprox` within `6m+4` (the `FitSpec6` clause).
